        Nothing here is marked right or wrong, because nothing in an essay can be: mdq.spec grades them manually.
        The first card is what <code class="font-mono">score()</code> actually returns — a placeholder flagged{" "}
        <code class="font-mono">pending</code>, badged "Awaiting grading" rather than "Score 0.00", since a human
