    <section class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">Readonly mode</h3>
      <p class="mb-5 text-sm text-base-content/60">
        The input is kept and disabled, unlike the essay view which drops its textarea entirely. A disabled number
