        One line of text. The patterns that decide the grade never reach the browser, but{" "}
        <code class="font-mono">preAccept</code> and <code class="font-mono">preReject</code> do &mdash; mdq.spec
        asks that a student be warned about an invalid submission <em>before</em> committing to it, and they
        describe the shape of an answer rather than its content. Type <code class="font-mono">many</code> or{" "}
        <code class="font-mono">0</code> into the second card to see it; the warning never blocks anything, and
