        not something the question claims to know about &mdash; it badges "Awaiting grading" rather than "Score
        0.00", and shows neither a check nor an x. Adding the wildcard back is how an author closes that off.
        Regexes never appear under "Accepted answers": a grading rule is not an answer anyone can read.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <Card title="Accepted">
          <ShortAnswerView
            client:load
            question={capital.toPublic()}
            mode="review"
            value="brasília"
